    <string name="analysis_model_title">Ink Reader model chapter detection (experimental)</string>
    <string name="analysis_model_hint">On opening, the on-device model finds headings the rules missed and runs a whole-book structural check (numbering continuity, repeated boilerplate, table-of-contents regions, front/back matter, sentence-ending punctuation). Candidates that pass become chapters directly; the rest still land in full-book review for you to confirm. Everything runs on this device — no text is uploaded, and you can undo at any time.</string>
